{"sections":[{"slug":"Fubini--Study度量","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Fubini--Study度量"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Fubini–Study <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Fubini–Study 度量”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射影空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb{C}P^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler流形","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的重要例子</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在非齐次坐标</span> $\\displaystyle t^i = \\frac{z^i}{z^0}$ <span lang=\"zh\">下</span>, Fubini–Study <span lang=\"zh\">度量可表示为</span>\n$$\r\ng_{i\\bar j} = \\frac{\\partial ^2}{\\partial t^i \\partial \\overline{t^j}}\r\n\\log\\left( 1+ \\sum_{k=1}^n |t^k|^2\\right).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">此时</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/基本形式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">基本形式</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可写为</span>\n$$\r\n\\gamma = \\sqrt{-1} \\partial \\bar\\partial \\log \\left(1+ \\sum_{k=1}^n |t^k|^2\\right).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它是线丛</span> $\\mathcal O(1)$ ("},{"Local":{"url":"/超平面丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">超平面丛</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">的第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}